  "markdown": "# Peta Learning Outcomes dan Cara Belajar\n\n> [!info] Sumber: syllabus resmi di Binusmaya (LMS), dibaca 20 Oktober 2026\n> Mata kuliah ENPR6107005, kelas LD28, 4 SKS. Buku: Locker, Mackiewicz, Aune (2025) *Business Communication*; Mandel (2023) *Brand Strategy in Three Steps*.\n\n## Penilaian\n| Komponen | Bobot | Jenis AI |\n|---|---|---|\n| Assignment (teori) | 20% | Lihat instruksi tugas |\n| Mid exam teori | 30% | Independent (tanpa AI) |\n| Project | 50% | Lihat instruksi tugas |\n\nRingkasan di aplikasi ini disusun untuk **mid exam**. Jadwal mid exam: 10 November 2026.\n\n## 5 Learning Outcome\n| LO | Level | Isi |\n|---|---|---|\n| LO1 | C1 Knowledge | Identify the role of effective business communication in supporting organizational performance, brand strategy, and professional career development |\n| LO2 | C2 Comprehension | Describe the principles of audience analysis, message structure, tone, and readability to produce clear and effective business messages |\n| LO3 | C2 Comprehension | Explain the use of digital tools, emerging technologies, and ethical considerations in modern business communication |\n| LO4 | C3 Application | Apply strategic communication techniques in developing business documents such as reports, proposals, and presentations aligned with business objectives |\n| LO5 | C3 Application | Apply purpose-driven communication concepts by integrating brand identity, customer value, and stakeholder needs in business contexts |\n\n## Indikator rubrik (apa yang dinilai)\n- **LO1:** jelaskan lebih dari 3 domain (organizational performance, brand strategy, career development); terapkan **6 prinsip** komunikasi bisnis.\n- **LO2:** jelaskan **4 prinsip** (audience analysis, message structure, tone, readability) dan beri lebih dari 3 contoh relevan.\n- **LO3:** jelaskan lebih dari 3 prinsip etika (data privacy, transparency, consent, confidentiality) dan lebih dari 3 alat digital atau teknologi baru.\n- **LO4:** teknik komunikasi strategis (audience targeting, message framing, persuasive strategy, clarity, structure) selaras dengan tujuan dokumen.\n- **LO5:** integrasikan brand identity, customer value, dan stakeholder needs.\n\n## Sesi yang sudah ada di aplikasi\n| Sesi | Judul | LO | Sub topik di syllabus |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 9 | Crafting Informative and Positive Messages | LO4 | Purpose; building goodwill; organizing; subject lines; transmittals and summaries; integrate visuals into text |\n| 10 | Crafting Negative Messages | LO4 | Parts; kinds; when and how to apologize; tone; ways to organize; purposes |\n\n> [!warning] Belum tercakup\n> Sesi 1 sampai 8 dan sesi setelah 10 (LO1, LO2, LO3, LO5) belum ada filenya, jadi belum ada di aplikasi."
